  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nThis ally gains 10% attack
    speed per Iron Swordsman talent, including itself, up to 30%. Count includes
    absorbed talents; star levels do not multiply this count.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE
    OWNED\nRun / Income: +2\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4;
    merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nTheir
    family mends coats left on station hooks. They recognise travellers by repairs
    nobody else notices. They kept one uncollected coat because its missing owner
    once covered a sleeping stranger with it.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nEvery 4s in combat,
    attempt to heal the hero for 1.5 HP before healing modifiers. Healing restrictions
    apply.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages
    are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers
    scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: clock, root, regal. Immortal. Weapon rolls
    on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent
    forbids it."
